{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## System Instructions\n\nFind the closest option based on the question and prediction.\n\nQuestion: A trader sold an article at a profit of 20% for Rs.360. What is the cost price of the article?\nPrediction: The cost price is Rs.300.00\nOptions: [A)270, B)300, C)280, D)320, E)315]\n\n## Tool Use\n\nUse the provided tool `extracted_data` to extract correct and accurate structured data from the input.\n\nTool purpose: Function call based on user instructions.\n\nCall the tool with the best supported arguments for the requested extraction."}],"max_completion_tokens":1024,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data","description":"Function call based on user instructions.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"choice":{"type":"string","enum":["A","B","C","D","E"]}},"required":["choice"],"additionalProperties":false}}}],"tool_choice":{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data"}},"reasoning_effort":"none"}